<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Swift Transport cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Swift Transport cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said it downgraded Swift Transportation Co Inc to buy from strong buy based on price.</p>
<p>-- Cited 70 percent share price appreciation since June 1996 and 36 percent price gain since start of this year.</p>
<p>-- 12-month price target is $37 per share.</p>
<p>-- Kept 1997 earnings estimate at $1.50 per share.</p>
<p>-- Kept 1998 earnings estimate at $1.75 per share.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 1/4 to 31-3/4.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
